<h2>Find your level · The team Second Brain</h2>
<p>Let's pull it together. <strong>Your whole project does not have to sit at a single level.</strong> One folder can be Level 2 while another is Level 4. There is exactly one way to choose — work backwards from the <strong>pain</strong> you are feeling right now.</p>

